\v 1 \add This letter is from\add* Yudas, a slave¦154734 of Yeshua the messiah, and brother¦154735 of Yacob. It's written to¦154738 all those who have been¦154742 called¦154750 and loved¦154742 by¦154739 \nd God¦154740\nd* the father¦154741 and who have kept¦154749 \add believing\add* in Yeshua the messiah.\x + \xo 1: \xt Mat 13:55; Mrk 6:3.\x*
