\v 4 Because¦154790 some¦154791 people¦154792 have¦154796 quietly come into \add our groups\add* who think they can take advantage of God's grace¦154807 to bring in immoral lifestyles and disowning¦154824 the only¦154814 master¦154816, and our boss who's \nd Yeshua\nd* the \nd messiah¦154822\nd*. But¦154811 they are destined for judgement¦154800.
