\v 9 Even Michael¦154934, \add one of\add* the top messengers, when¦154938 he was arguing with the devil¦154940 about¦154943 Mosheh's body¦154946, he didn't¦154947 belittle him, but¦154933 left it to \nd Yahweh¦154959\nd* to punish him.\x + \xo 9: a \xt Dan 10:13,21; 12:1; Rev 12:7; \xo b \xt Deu 34:6; \xo c \xt Zech 3:2.\x*
