\v 11 Oh dear! Because¦154981 they've followed the actions of Cain¦154985\x + \xo 11: \xt Gen 4:3-8; 1Yhn 3:12.\x* and¦154987 have embraced the deception¦154989 of Balaam¦154992\x + \xo 11: \xt Num 22–24; 31:16; 2Pe 2:15-16.\x* for¦154993 monetary gain, so too they'll perish¦155000 like Korah's destruction.\x + \xo 11: \xt Num 16:1-35.\x*
\v 12 These¦155001 are the people who ruin your¦155015 love¦155013 feasts¦155013 when they eat without shame and only look after themselves¦155023. They're like clouds¦155025 that are blown away by the wind¦155029 without bringing the needed rain or trees¦155034 that don't produce any fruit then are doubly useless by falling over;
\v 13 like wild¦155044 waves¦155042 in the ocean that foam in their own shame¦155051 or like \add unreliable\add* wandering¦155053 stars¦155052 that are already doomed to¦155054 the darkest darkness¦155056 in the next age¦155061.
