\v 15 to sentence everybody and to punish everyone who rejected God for everything they did that¦155105 demonstrated this rejection and everything they said against¦155116 him¦155117.”
\v 16 This includes their grumbling¦155122 and complaining¦155123, the fulfilling of their own lustful desires, the arrogant¦155137 way that they spoke¦155136, and their flattering of others in order to gain from them¦155134.
\s1 Keep your faith and keep ministering to others
