\s1 Honouring God
\rem /s1 Doxology; Benediction; A Prayer of Praise
\p
\v 24-25 Our master, Yeshua the messiah, is the infallible¦155274 one who is quite capable of looking after all¦155271 of us so that we can stand¦155279 blameless¦155287 in front¦155280 of him and praise him in his full honour and greatness. Let us honour and praise our only God and saviour, acknowledging his greatness and power and authority through Yeshua from before the creation, right through these current times, and in the age to come. May it be so.
